{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Shall it not rise like the river</b> — missing a yod, as though written כיאור. Proof: he repeats this verse at the end of the chapter, and there it is written עלתה כיאור כולה. The meaning: the earth is fit to quake and sink, for it rests upon the waters. Thus it is written: 'who spreads the earth upon the waters.'"], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:34.839815466Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}